-// @reqflow/llm — Owner: WS7 (see docs/WORKSTREAMS.md).
-// Implements the LlmClient interface from @reqflow/core:
-//   createLlmClient(settings.llm, { apiKey }) → "anthropic" provider (Claude API) | "mock" provider (offline, schema-valid canned output)
-// Prompts live next to the blocks that use them; shared prompt helpers (evidence citation rules) live here.
